  [>] Missed: Braille Divine Tome of Carim (+ Morne's Ring)
      On the Road of Sacrifices, a drop-down platform near the bridge to the Halfway Fortress holds the Braille Divine Tome of Carim and Morne's Ring. Give the tome to Irina of Carim at Firelink to unlock Med Heal, Tears of Denial and Force - it is a LIGHT tome, completely safe for her questline. How to get back: Warp to the Road of Sacrifices bonfire, head toward the bridge before Halfway Fortress, look down over the cliff edge for the platform with two corpses and drop down.
  [>] Siegward is stuck in the well by the Cleansing Chapel
      Outside the Cleansing Chapel bonfire, a voice hums from the well - it's Siegward, robbed of his armor. Once Patches (in Firelink, after his Cathedral tricks) sells you the Catarina Set, come back to the well and give it to Siegward. Do this BEFORE progressing deep into Irithyll - his questline (and one of the two ways to save Greirat later) depends on it.
  [i] Missed: Grass Crest Shield (stamina regen for every build)
      The Grass Crest Shield boosts stamina regeneration even when held on your back - it is used by virtually every build in the game. It sits in the Crucifixion Woods water near the big crab. How to get back: From the Crucifixion Woods bonfire, head into the shallow water toward the ruins; the shield is on a corpse near where the Great Crab prowls - grab it and run.
  [i] Missed: Exile Greatsword / Great Club from the Exile duo
      The two exile watchmen guarding the Farron Keep entrance drop the Exile Greatsword and the Great Club - both top-tier strength weapons for this stage of the game. How to get back: Warp to the Crucifixion Woods bonfire and head toward the door to Farron Keep at the water's edge; the two exiles patrol the slope in front of it. They respawn until killed in your world.
  [i] Rosaria's Bed Chamber: respec and appearance change
      Rosaria, Mother of Rebirth, rests in a chamber off the Cathedral's upper hall (fight past the Man-grub caster for the Red Sign Soapstone, then open the double doors). Joining her covenant lets you reallocate stats or change appearance up to 5 times per playthrough, paying one Pale Tongue each. Just JOINING is safe for other questlines - but do not OFFER Pale Tongues to level the covenant while Sirris's questline is active.
